{"input":"WAIT UNTIL 7AM","clock":{"tick":1030,"due":1381,"day":1,"minute":9,"hour":1,"period":"am","label":"Tue 01:09am"},"room":12,"outcome":"game_over","notice":null,"text":["Inspector Lestrade enters.","Inspector Lestrade says to you \" Good evening \".","Inspector Lestrade remarks \" Well can you prove that Major Percival Ffoulkes visited the opium den yet, Holmes ? \".","Inspector Lestrade says to Watson \" Hello \".","Watson says to Inspector Lestrade \" Good evening \".","Major Percival Ffoulkes enters.","As the Major enters Lestrade attempts to arrest him. The Major draws a gun and fires wildly at Lestrade, who pulls his revolver and kills Major Ffoulkes with a single shot.","Inspector Lestrade says to you \" Well Holmes that wraps up this case, sorry you were not of more help but you cannot solve them all you know. \". Despite his assurances you cannot help feeling there should be more to this case. Perhaps you should try again."],"actors":[{"id":2,"room":12},{"id":3,"room":12},{"id":6,"room":61},{"id":13,"room":0},{"id":95,"room":0}],"facts":[{"start":"9965","flags":165,"terms":[1543,36195,0,2048]},{"start":"9973","flags":164,"terms":[46,16441,93,2141]},{"start":"9981","flags":164,"terms":[72,16450,67,16451,0,0,0,2048]},{"start":"9997","flags":164,"terms":[87,16472,90,16467,81,18513]},{"start":"99a9","flags":164,"terms":[0,0,85,16469,0,2560]}],"ending":{"entry":"9E74","reason":"story","text_pointer":"69BF"}}
